{"task_type": "build", "component": "build_lfs_validation_harness", "description": "Build a pre-training LFS validation harness that provisions a minimal RunPod pod, pushes a 200MB dummy file via git-lfs to a test branch on rob531/zomesh-sentinel-sft, verifies the blob lands at full size via Trees API, and terminates the pod. Must pass before any real SFT training run. Catches the silent LFS upload failure that lost v1 adapter on 2026-05-02. Exit codes: 0=LFS works, 1=LFS silently broken (use chunk fallback). Uses zocomputerRPMay and RUnpodGHAPI env vars.", "priority": "high", "confidence": 0.93}